<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1740478908"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:59.077"><div begin="18.304" end="45.086" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="18.304" end="24.757" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.304" end="19.288">我</span> <span begin="19.675" end="20.239">面对</span><span begin="20.239" end="20.716">这</span><span begin="20.716" end="21.000">份</span><span begin="21.000" end="21.595">爱</span> <span begin="21.595" end="21.920">不</span><span begin="21.920" end="22.623">止</span><span begin="22.623" end="22.862">抱</span><span begin="22.862" end="23.494">歉</span><span begin="23.536" end="23.821">万</span><span begin="23.821" end="24.757">次</span></p><p begin="27.098" end="31.013" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.098" end="27.723">唯独</span><span begin="27.723" end="29.510">你怎么都</span><span begin="29.510" end="29.973">不</span><span begin="29.973" end="30.353">介</span><span begin="30.353" end="31.013">意</span></p><p begin="31.207" end="39.300" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.207" end="31.845">闲</span><span begin="31.845" end="32.180">话</span><span begin="32.180" end="32.987">任人</span><span begin="32.987" end="34.060">讲</span> <span begin="34.439" end="34.882">几</span><span begin="34.882" end="35.400">多</span><span begin="35.400" end="35.770">诋</span><span begin="35.770" end="36.675">毁咒</span><span begin="36.675" end="37.313">骂</span><span begin="37.313" end="37.672">仍</span><span begin="37.672" end="38.420">旧坚</span><span begin="38.420" end="39.300">持</span></p><p begin="40.185" end="45.086" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.185" end="40.636">在</span><span begin="40.636" end="41.079">我</span><span begin="41.079" end="41.325">害</span><span begin="41.325" end="42.144">怕之</span><span begin="42.144" end="42.741">时</span> <span begin="42.792" end="43.134">说</span><span begin="43.134" end="44.062">我可</span><span begin="44.062" end="45.086">以</span></p></div><div begin="47.798" end="1:17.125" itunes:songPart="Verse"